        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten-year-old Margo exists in the shadow of her vibrant older sister, Janice, a shadow cast by parents who are too busy admiring one child to truly see the other, leaving Margo to navigate a world of quiet yearning and internal suffering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Quiet Hum of a Lonely Heart is a short kinetic novel that features ~5K words and 34 images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features themes such as: Loneliness and isolation within a family</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sibling rivalry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Self-worth and identity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nature of parental love and unintentional neglect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding one's voice and inner strength</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The power of imagination and quiet observation</p>",
